

1. Top-level architecture

Core idea:A Field Blueprint Engine that:

Represents reality as fields + organisms defined in a Blueprint DSL.

Evolves them via a Field Kernel (equations, constraints, updates).

Wraps everything in an Identity & Encryption Layer bound toC. MATTHEW BLACKWELL — Independent Designer as cryptographic author.

Main layers:

Blueprint DSL Layer — how you describe fields, entities, laws.

Field Kernel Layer — how the engine evolves them.

